ple Input  3 aaab baa aaa Sample Output  3 0 -1 Explanation  Test Case 1: \"aaab\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 2: \"baa\"  Removing 'b' at index  results in a palindrome, so we print  on a new line.  Test Case 3: \"aaa\"  This string is already a palindrome, so we print ; however, , , and  are also all acceptable answers, as the string will still be a palindrome if any one of the characters at those indices are removed.","topics":[],"score":213187,"global_rank":259816,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":41611},{"name":"jordanengstrom/rest_quest","owner":"jordanengstrom","html_url":"https://github.com/jordanengstrom/rest_quest","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":213186,"global_rank":259820,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":41612},{"name":"tbw875/daily-balance","owner":"tbw875","html_url":"https://github.com/tbw875/daily-balance","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Fetching, storing, and alerting on daily balances of clusters across CEX's across assets.","topics":[],"score":213185,"global_rank":259823,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":41613},{"name":"SPThreatt/Sentiment-Analysis","owner":"SPThreatt","html_url":"https://github.com/SPThreatt/Sentiment-Analysis","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"AI Models Specializing in Determining Sentiment","topics":[],"score":213185,"global_rank":259824,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":41614},{"name":"jamesbiederbeck/HashAppraiser","owner":"jamesbiederbeck","html_url":"https://github.com/jamesbiederbeck/HashAppraiser","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":213183,"global_rank":259851,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":41615},{"name":"dlauritzen/SqlRest","owner":"dlauritzen","html_url":"https://git